  "solution": "<div class=\"with-figure\"><div>Ta có \n\t\t\t<ul><li>Vì <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>I</mi></semantics></math> là trung điểm <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow></semantics></math> nên <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mover><mrow><mi>I</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover></semantics></math> và <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mover><mrow><mi>I</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover></semantics></math> là hai véc-tơ đối nhau.</li><li>Ta có <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mover><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>I</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover></mrow></semantics></math>.</li><li>Ta có <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>G</mi><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>G</mi><mi>I</mi></mrow></semantics></math>, mặt khác <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mover><mrow><mi>G</mi><mi>A</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover></semantics></math> và <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mover><mrow><mi>G</mi><mi>I</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover></semantics></math> ngược hướng nên <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover><mrow><mi>G</mi><mi>A</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mover><mrow><mi>G</mi><mi>I</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover></mrow></semantics></math>.</li><li>Với mọi điểm <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>M</mi></semantics></math> bất kỳ, ta luôn có <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover><mrow><mi>M</mi><mi>A</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mrow><mi>M</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mrow><mi>M</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mover><mrow><mi>M</mi><mi>G</mi></mrow><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover></mrow></semantics></math> với <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>G</mi></semantics></math> là trọng tâm tam giác <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow></semantics></math>.</li></ul>\n\t\t\tVậy trong các mệnh đề trên, có <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mn>2</mn></semantics></math> mệnh đề đúng.</div><div class=\"side-figure\"><figure class=\"tex-figure\"><img src=\"/bank-assets/1942690d6328afc97738d55673291730a4e75b73e9156f94b8016add7a5cb447.svg\" alt=\"Hình minh họa\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"figure-zoom\" aria-hidden=\"true\">⤢</span></figure></div></div>",
